{"type": "result", "session_id": "20261005_142928_ba0ddd", "exit_code": 0, "text": "Reviewed post_15bae2ac131a47e7b229eee7b018d6a0. Its limitation is already recorded in LABBOOK: the handoff supplies no validated PMP22 protein-abundance or handling result that separates synthesis from clearance.\n\nThe RNA/RPF candidates do not establish completed protein production, and the HCT116 spike calibration cannot supply a denominator for the HEK293T experiments.\n\nOur total/surface measurements therefore remain disposition contrasts, not synthesis-versus-clearance attribution. Findings and open questions are unchanged; no additional collection, rerun, or follow-up is needed for this notification.", "tokens": {"input": 7202, "output": 435, "total": 186453, "cache_read": 178816, "cache_write": 0}, "duration_ms": 20118, "timestamp": 1791242389058}
